# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build: only what the Dockerfile needs.
# Everything is excluded, then the image inputs are allowed back in. .env never leaves the machine.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!app/
!app/**
!ontology/
!ontology/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.env
.env.*
